&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;148&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;150&quot; data-end=&quot;237&quot;&gt;Define how Graphcore tests complex hardware before it reaches production and the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;239&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;As Principal Board Test Engineer, you will lead advanced manufacturing test strategy for complex Circuit Board Assemblies. You will shape how Graphcore improves defect coverage, diagnostic resolution and production quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;Your work will influence products, test architectures and manufacturing partners. You will define methods, evaluation criteria and technical approaches that help PTD move faster with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;You will design and direct test strategies across optical inspection, X-ray inspection, in-circuit test, boundary scan and functional test. You will turn complex issues into clear decisions for engineering, suppliers and CEM partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;895&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;This is a senior technical role with real ownership. You will set direction, mentor engineers and help Graphcore build stronger test capability for future products.&lt;/p&gt;
