&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build the cloud platform that puts Graphcore AI systems into real use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
